  "question": {
    "text": "<p>An acidic solution of dichromate is electrolyzed for 8 minutes using 2 A current. As per the following&nbsp;equation</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Cr</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math><br />The amount of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Cr</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>. obtained was <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>104</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>. The efficiency of the process <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>in</mi><mo>%</mo><mo>)</mo></math> is (Take : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>960000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>, At. mass of chromium <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>52</mn></math>)</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "60",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Charge&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>it</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>960</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>960</mn><mn>96000</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Cr</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>7</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mole</mi></math></p><p>Theoritical mass of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Cr</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>600</mn><mn>96000</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>173</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p><p>So, efficiency&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi>actual</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi>Theoritial</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>104</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>173</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>%</mo></math></p>",
